I looked at the tests and they are EXPECT_FLOAT_EQ. In other parts of the tests we use EXPECT_NEAR and specify a tolerance. My suggestion would be to replace the current EXPECT_FLOAT_EQ with EXPECT_NEAR.

We should look into the first error. The one from src/test/command/print_test.cpp.

Can you run the command listed?

"bin\print src\test\command\print_samples\matrix_output.csv"

